  "notes": "METEOR v157, the released ONNX as shipped (meteor_v157c3Z.onnx, METEOR pinned at dc193a81; onnxruntime's CUDA provider), driven on Paddock 2eaedb5 (main after #159 and #160) over every route of bench2drive220.xml at Bench2Drive 7ec25d1, the routes set aside for every model left out (issue #158, the 220-route protocol). Asked at its declared planning_hz of 5 (one /infer every 0.2 s, the last plan followed in between); paddock's camera rig, six cameras in six of its eight slots, the two telephoto slots absent; no driving command (the graph takes none), the argmax of its plans; early stop at 30 s without 3 m of progress or 4x Think2Drive's time; up to three attempts a route; no site value for anything model.yaml declares; 3 workers on each of two A100 80GB, 7 Nov 02:36 to 06:01 UTC. 4 route(s) set aside for every model (3800: CARLA crashes (signal 11) 63-69 s into the route on every attempt by Alpamayo 1.5 at its declared 10 Hz; 11715: CARLA crashes (signal 11) about 54 s into the route on every attempt, whichever model drives; 23695: CARLA crashes (signal 11) about 40 s into the route on every attempt by Alpamayo 1.5 at its declared 10 Hz; 24071: CARLA crashes (signal 11) 37-40 s into the route on every attempt by Alpamayo 1.5 at its declared 10 Hz): a route the simulator fails on every time measures no model, so it is in no mean and not counted as lost; 3800, 23695, 24071 left out although they scored here, as for every model. 37 of 37 source runs kept no run.json, so their routes are attributed to meteor on the tree they were found in; config.model_env and the rest of config are what 37/37 source runs recorded. asked for a plan at 5 Hz, the planning_hz the model's model.yaml declared for these runs, the last plan followed in between. early stop (30 s without 3 m of route progress or 4x the expert's time on the route (none on the 9 route(s) here with no expert drive)): a car in a driving scene is expected to move, to finish in reasonable time and not to collide, so a route ended this way is a failed drive, scored as it stood when it ended (a collision's penalty included).",
  "ingested_from": "paddock_runs/bench2drive/meteor"
